{
 "total": 32.16,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This looks like one flower on a stick.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.995
  },
  {
   "text": "But it's a whole crowd of animals.",
   "visual": "crowd",
   "start": 1.995,
   "end": 3.745
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a droopy sea pen.",
   "visual": "name",
   "start": 3.745,
   "end": 5.332
  },
  {
   "text": "It all starts with one tiny polyp.",
   "visual": "grow",
   "start": 5.332,
   "end": 7.504
  },
  {
   "text": "That polyp grows into a long stalk.",
   "visual": "grow",
   "start": 7.504,
   "end": 9.711
  },
  {
   "text": "Then new polyps bud at the top, like copies of itself.",
   "visual": "bud",
   "start": 9.711,
   "end": 12.742
  },
  {
   "text": "Some catch food with feathery tentacles.",
   "visual": "feeders",
   "start": 12.742,
   "end": 15.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Others pump water through the colony.",
   "visual": "pumps",
   "start": 15.132,
   "end": 17.185
  },
  {
   "text": "Its swollen base anchors it in the mud.",
   "visual": "anchor",
   "start": 17.185,
   "end": 19.627
  },
  {
   "text": "And the stalk can grow taller than two meters.",
   "visual": "tall",
   "start": 19.627,
   "end": 22.241
  },
  {
   "text": "The current pushes the head over, and the tentacles grab passing food.",
   "visual": "current",
   "start": 22.241,
   "end": 26.089
  },
  {
   "text": "So that flower is really a team, working as one.",
   "visual": "team",
   "start": 26.089,
   "end": 29.13
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow BioNiche for more weird animals.",
   "visual": "cta",
   "start": 29.13,
   "end": 32.16
  }
 ],
